# Project dictionary for the fiches de cadrage. Versioned on purpose: `zg` on a
# word writes here, so the vocabulary accumulates across machines instead of
# being relearnt. `zug` undoes one. Neovim recompiles the .add.spl beside this
# file automatically; that artefact is gitignored.
#
# Seeded from the words actually flagged across every fiche, keeping only those
# that appeared TWICE OR MORE. One-off oddities are left flagged on purpose --
# that is the only thing still catching a genuine typo.
#
# Ticket references (DEV-1937 and friends) are NOT here and cannot be: the
# spell checker treats each one as a single word, so the set is unbounded.
# Writing them as `DEV-1937` in backticks makes them vanish for free -- the
# markdown_inline query marks code spans @nospell.

# -- domain / client vocabulary --
DPGF
CCTP
BPU
CRA
BTP
Sillant
sillant-context
vicat
price-bible
sous-total
sous-types
tout-ou-rien

# -- French the bundled fr dictionary does not know --
validateur
renommage
mergé
ᵉ
ᵉʳ

